    - target: {fileID: 8260441347216254583, guid: 9688bd7d24000204a8da8f3f72d2bbfe,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: NotesDummyText
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8834723086977553512, guid: 9688bd7d24000204a8da8f3f72d2bbfe,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Respect: \r\nYael seems to deeply value the respect of the village,
        and she definitely wants to keep up appearances to them.\r\nJasper believes
        that Yael should earn her respect.\r\nYael believes that Jasper should already
        respect her as a colleague. \r\nJasper thinks Yael is flaunting her rich
        vocabulary to poke fun at her - the Sunblades don\u2019t use such flowery
        language.\r\nYael thinks Jasper\u2019s blunt language is an indication of
        her lack of respect for Yael! \r\nFriendship: \r\nYael doesn\u2019t seem
        to have many friends, but this doesn\u2019t bother her. \r\nJasper misses
        her friends, and it\u2019s paining her deeply.\r\nYael seems confused by
        the Tether\u2019s connection between the two of them and expected her Tethered
        to be her partner.  \r\nJasper trusts that the Tether has chosen correctly,
        regardless of her skepticism - and does not need to be friends with her Tethered.\r\nGift
        Ettiquite: \r\nYael does not believe in taking gifts without anything to
        give in return. \r\nJasper believes that gifts should be accepted regardless.
        \r\nYael thinks she should never receive a gift with dirty hands. \r\n\r\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8834723086977553512, guid: 9688bd7d24000204a8da8f3f72d2bbfe,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_overflowMode
      value: 4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    m_RemovedComponents: []
  m_SourcePrefab: {fileID: 100100000, guid: 9688bd7d24000204a8da8f3f72d2bbfe, type: 3}
